  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: bdc1efb33ef514c49aeb8e2796048130, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 15ba64ee8dbd8be4a985f9a497cfa4c3, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f68acb30a6782cd4ab7c345e266c8b04, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52cd862ab91f2914f97ed7e1ba846531, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ec3e18e4a8236ed40aea3975c7f7bba8, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: c58b5c607d2dc9a44a41cc1e1f7f556b, type: 3}
  slideTexts:
  - The sky tears apart with explosions. The city turns to ruins under alien ship
    fire.
  - Through smoke and debris he runs toward the exit. Every step could be his last
  - A faint blue light flickers among the wreckage. An old military robot might still
    be useful.
  - Sparks fly under his hands. Robot systems come alive one by one.
  - Asteroids are full of valuable ore. Together they begin a new life among the
    stars.
  - The cargo hold is full of crystals. Now they have everything to start - and a
    loyal friend beside.
  slideDisplayDuration: 3
  fadeInDuration: 0.5
  fadeOutDuration: 0.5
